(text "Raspberry Pi CM4" (at 20 10 0) (effects (font (size 3.5 3.5) bold) (justify left top)) (uuid 079e82ec-f4f0-5dfd-a755-346cc2713c64))
(text "O módulo CM4 (BCM2711, 4 GB, eMMC) roda o Linux e o LiveSafe Monitor. Os GPIO trabalham em 3,3 V (GPIO_VREF ligado à saída de 3,3 V do próprio CM4)." (at 20 17 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left top)) (uuid ec2e98bb-deb0-5bcc-9d5a-96b412042a89))
(text "- config.txt: dtoverlay=dwc2,dr_mode=host (USB do CM4 como host do hub), dtoverlay=tc358743, dtoverlay=tc358743-audio, dtparam=i2c_arm=on, dtparam=spi=on, dtoverlay=i2c-rtc,pcf85063a,i2c_csi_dsi" (at 20 22.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) italic) (justify left top)) (uuid 3043a34c-f3f2-577a-a242-db302d210e55))
(text "- Chave GRAVAR: leva nRPIBOOT a 0 e passa a USB do CM4 para o micro-USB interno (rpiboot / gravar o eMMC)." (at 20 25.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) italic) (justify left top)) (uuid 7e932a21-a9c3-52cd-aabb-3b1b51309ee6))
(text "Marcos Silva dos Santos (MarcosObel) - github.com/aragonxpd154/LiveSafe-Monitor - CERN-OHL-S-2.0" (at 20 408 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid cd311c20-1a0c-567e-b72e-53bf628575fb))
